    "body": "The `stl_tree_node`, `list_node` and `unordered_node` class templates only mimic the layout of the standard library's container nodes, so that `sizeof` yields an estimate of the memory they use. Their fields are never accessed.\n\nSince llvm/llvm-project#237374, Clang 24 diagnoses these fields with `-Wunused-private-field`:\n```console\n$ cmake --build build\n[308/655] Building CXX object src/util/CMakeFiles/bitcoin_util.dir/__/logging.cpp.o\nIn file included from ../src/logging.cpp:7:\n../src/memusage.h:169:11: warning: private field 'ptr_next' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n  169 |     void* ptr_next;\n      |           ^\n../src/memusage.h:170:11: warning: private field 'ptr_prev' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n  170 |     void* ptr_prev;\n      |           ^\n2 warnings generated.\n[355/655] Building CXX object src/CMakeFiles/bitcoin_node.dir/kernel/disconnected_transactions.cpp.o\nIn file included from ../src/kernel/disconnected_transactions.cpp:8:\nIn file included from ../src/core_memusage.h:10:\n../src/memusage.h:184:11: warning: private field 'ptr' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n  184 |     void* ptr;\n      |           ^\n../src/memusage.h:169:11: warning: private field 'ptr_next' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n  169 |     void* ptr_next;\n      |           ^\n../src/memusage.h:170:11: warning: private field 'ptr_prev' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n  170 |     void* ptr_prev;\n      |           ^\n3 warnings generated.\n[424/655] Building CXX object src/CMakeFiles/bitcoin_node.dir/txgraph.cpp.o\nIn file included from ../src/txgraph.cpp:7:\nIn file included from ../src/cluster_linearize.h:17:\n../src/memusage.h:72:9: warning: private field 'color' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n   72 |     int color;\n      |         ^\n../src/memusage.h:73:11: warning: private field 'parent' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n   73 |     void* parent;\n      |           ^\n../src/memusage.h:74:11: warning: private field 'left' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n   74 |     void* left;\n      |           ^\n../src/memusage.h:75:11: warning: private field 'right' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n   75 |     void* right;\n      |           ^\n4 warnings generated.\n[425/655] Building CXX object src/CMakeFiles/bitcoin_node.dir/txmempool.cpp.o\nIn file included from ../src/txmempool.cpp:6:\nIn file included from ../src/txmempool.h:9:\nIn file included from ../src/coins.h:11:\nIn file included from ../src/core_memusage.h:10:\n../src/memusage.h:72:9: warning: private field 'color' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n   72 |     int color;\n      |         ^\n../src/memusage.h:73:11: warning: private field 'parent' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n   73 |     void* parent;\n      |           ^\n../src/memusage.h:74:11: warning: private field 'left' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n   74 |     void* left;\n      |           ^\n../src/memusage.h:75:11: warning: private field 'right' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n   75 |     void* right;\n      |           ^\n../src/memusage.h:72:9: warning: private field 'color' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n   72 |     int color;\n      |         ^\n../src/memusage.h:73:11: warning: private field 'parent' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n   73 |     void* parent;\n      |           ^\n../src/memusage.h:74:11: warning: private field 'left' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n   74 |     void* left;\n      |           ^\n../src/memusage.h:75:11: warning: private field 'right' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n   75 |     void* right;\n      |           ^\n../src/memusage.h:72:9: warning: private field 'color' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n   72 |     int color;\n      |         ^\n../src/memusage.h:73:11: warning: private field 'parent' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n   73 |     void* parent;\n      |           ^\n../src/memusage.h:74:11: warning: private field 'left' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n   74 |     void* left;\n      |           ^\n../src/memusage.h:75:11: warning: private field 'right' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n   75 |     void* right;\n      |           ^\n12 warnings generated.\n[535/655] Building CXX object src/test/CMakeFiles/test_bitcoin.dir/disconnected_transactions.cpp.o\nIn file included from ../src/test/disconnected_transactions.cpp:6:\nIn file included from ../src/core_memusage.h:10:\n../src/memusage.h:184:11: warning: private field 'ptr' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n  184 |     void* ptr;\n      |           ^\n1 warning generated.\n[566/655] Building CXX object src/test/CMakeFiles/test_bitcoin.dir/pool_tests.cpp.o\nIn file included from ../src/test/pool_tests.cpp:5:\n../src/memusage.h:184:11: warning: private field 'ptr' is not used [-Wunused-private-field]\n  184 |     void* ptr;\n      |           ^\n1 warning generated.\n[655/655] Linking CXX executable bin/test_bitcoin\n```\n\nThis PR drops the `private:` access specifiers. It does not affect the size or alignment of the structs, as all their fields keep the same access control, and it is consistent with `stl_shared_counter`.",
