        "sha": "dd43391f168d3fdd9a262b4a05a087118d7a79bd",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/dd43391f168d3fdd9a262b4a05a087118d7a79bd"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree dd43391f168d3fdd9a262b4a05a087118d7a79bd\nparent a527a0077a0fcae913188410214efe98021c0cca\nauthor Hennadii Stepanov <32963518+hebasto@users.noreply.github.com> 1794657882 +0000\ncommitter Hennadii Stepanov <32963518+hebasto@users.noreply.github.com> 1794657882 +0000\n\nmemusage: Make fields of STL helper structs public\n\nThe `stl_tree_node`, `list_node` and `unordered_node` class templates\nonly mimic the layout of the standard library's container nodes, so\nthat `sizeof` yields an estimate of the memory they use. Their fields\nare never accessed.\n\nSince llvm/llvm-project#237374, Clang 24 diagnoses these fields with\n`-Wunused-private-field`.\n\nThis change drops the `private:` access specifiers. It does not affect\nthe size or alignment of the structs, as all their fields keep the same\naccess control, and it is consistent with `stl_shared_counter`.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEE0dvyxLlvLev0wWZUQQEIES5+qB8FAmr4TloACgkQQQEIES5+\nqB/ooxAAg0HL9NP2MfBNaIxTM1Tmhvrq3X+i9CB43CGnyjFvbIcKp3m/78Sa50t0\nls10ELiuoxX0cG9HnJlk5esk2bi6VrXOkJbE8CoOMKagMa1C7FeKS4rOaYiLL/Yn\nbuGnGfA7rQfp+JY0dQRT5+Z4rsyHTBzKsvWs29g9/ksUzWQPOqTDqTu7zqDKOUW5\n5ktlEGqA9pzE++N5PPJGCQPLeoAwzj7y5adKHTbkF94DAcgH9jByxY/F9y3hamg/\nsO/8qm6Pzt0ifauk+CqzzJOF7lBwy/+gOnOkoWBMe7O38ybsK6JdiyJMr0ireQLQ\nOrMh193u3ei9fYcOvInEm2HH7gDiADWvJzp3DefVRyK/gCR1X5VWPtROa+Qiyzvu\nbh3rxIMttIF9sijsjF31Syg2lqAYqZPxrfShKthTIwg6YriQjsz3W5zawXM0H4vP\ntTbmJBVFcLG6OOsnLK3wvvAZwXFS1yK9Y2tSStzuEZEu4z6sQViGHuxRlx//YMZR\nez4CJHb0HgoFQFh00rvFDZhdvO1gHLzgXCpfVlk9O5YA3SkG49a70tuoT1bwI6ZC\nCePLfagI8iu3zVPKKJTbVRMDQvu+7WLuq+Id5+VmfZCOEeZznrXMFdDla2FNb6sz\nDsUUQr8/asuuw6dZc8TMQZRpOWXi22XHAxbYZP7h+vA1pKiZEvU=\n=nq//\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
